WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Welcome to The Recruiting Playbook. I’m Brian Kennedy

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:07.040
Jr. Your goal is a school-fit comparison. Write

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.040
two schools you want to compare and one

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.000
academic or practical requirement you need to verify.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.960
Keep your work private, record what you tried,

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.080
and set a review date. An offer, roster

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.080
spot, scholarship or admission is not guaranteed; current

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.240
rules need authoritative verification.
